ype-small block text-12 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</span></td></tr><tr data-testid="play-alternative" data-executable="true" class="border-b border-line align-top last:border-b-0"><td class="w-[28%] min-w-[160px] py-2 pr-3"><button type="button" data-testid="play-select" aria-pressed="false" class="type-small text-left font-semibold text-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-mono mr-1.5 text-11 text-muted">2</span>The regional brokers</button><span class="type-mono mt-0.5 block text-11 text-muted"></span></td><td class="w-[30%] py-2 pr-3"><span class="type-small block text-12">50 to 500 staff · Runs it: Claims team leader</span></td><td class="w-[42%] py-2"><span class="type-small block text-12 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</span></td></tr><tr data-testid="play-alternative" data-executable="true" class="border-b border-line align-top last:border-b-0"><td class="w-[28%] min-w-[160px] py-2 pr-3"><button type="button" data-testid="play-select" aria-pressed="false" class="type-small text-left font-semibold text-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-mono mr-1.5 text-11 text-muted">3</span>The delegated mgas</button><span class="type-mono mt-0.5 block text-11 text-muted"></span></td><td class="w-[30%] py-2 pr-3"><span class="type-small block text-12">50 to 500 staff · Runs it: Claims team leader</span></td><td class="w-[42%] py-2"><span class="type-small block text-12 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-testid="play-recommended" data-rank="1" class="border-t border-line pt-3"><p class="type-label mb-1.5">The play Confirm starts with<span class="type-mono ml-2 text-11 font-normal text-muted">Play 1 · Recommended</span></p><h3 class="type-name mb-2">The claims teams</h3><dl class="grid max-w-measure grid-cols-1 gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 wide:max-w-none wide:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)]"><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Who</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span class="font-semibold">The claims teams</span><span class="text-muted"> · 50 to 500 staff</span><span class="mt-0.5 block">Runs it: Claims team leader · Signs it off: Head of claims</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-muted">A mid-sized firm with its own claims line.</span></dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Why now</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">The July guidance.</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Not the right call if</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Why this first</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Every call checked.</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">The problem</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">claims-teams pain 1: handlers say the complaints backlog grew after the storms<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://source-1.example/page" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">source-1.example</a> · 14 Jul 2026</span></span></div></dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Example firms</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">claims-teams firm 1</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Suits</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Email</dd></div></dl></section><section data-testid="confirm-card" class="border-t border-line pt-3"><h3 class="type-label mb-1.5">What Confirm does</h3><p data-testid="confirm-starts-with" class="type-small mb-1.5"><span class="font-semibold">Confirm starts with</span> The claims teams</p><ul class="grid max-w-measure gap-1"><li class="type-small">Starts with this play and the kind of buyer it aims at.</li><li class="type-small">Buys no emails and sends nothing. You review everyone first.</li></ul><p class="type-small mt-1.5 max-w-measure text-muted"><span class="font-semibold">Lawful basis you confirm:</span> <span data-testid="confirm-lawful">Legitimate interest: B2B offer, opt out in every email</span></p></section></div></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-research" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Research</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpanel" data-testid="rail-panel-brief" class="max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--relay-header-h,0px)-72px)] overflow-y-auto p-card"><div data-testid="brief-bare"><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Direct</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">Practice owners at independent vets in Orkney</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">10 people over 3 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-3"><a data-testid="edit-brief" class="inline-flex min-h-6 items-center rounded-pill text-13 font-semibold text-action focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2" href="/campaigns/camp-complete/edit">Edit brief</a></div></div></div></aside></div></div>"`;

