ype-small block text-12 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</span></td></tr><tr data-testid="play-alternative" data-executable="true" class="border-b border-line align-top last:border-b-0"><td class="w-[28%] min-w-[160px] py-2 pr-3"><button type="button" data-testid="play-select" aria-pressed="false" class="type-small text-left font-semibold text-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-mono mr-1.5 text-11 text-muted">2</span>The regional brokers</button><span class="type-mono mt-0.5 block text-11 text-muted"></span></td><td class="w-[30%] py-2 pr-3"><span class="type-small block text-12">50 to 500 staff · Runs it: Claims team leader</span></td><td class="w-[42%] py-2"><span class="type-small block text-12 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</span></td></tr><tr data-testid="play-alternative" data-executable="true" class="border-b border-line align-top last:border-b-0"><td class="w-[28%] min-w-[160px] py-2 pr-3"><button type="button" data-testid="play-select" aria-pressed="false" class="type-small text-left font-semibold text-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-mono mr-1.5 text-11 text-muted">3</span>The delegated mgas</button><span class="type-mono mt-0.5 block text-11 text-muted"></span></td><td class="w-[30%] py-2 pr-3"><span class="type-small block text-12">50 to 500 staff · Runs it: Claims team leader</span></td><td class="w-[42%] py-2"><span class="type-small block text-12 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-testid="play-recommended" data-rank="1" class="border-t border-line pt-3"><p class="type-label mb-1.5">The play Confirm starts with<span class="type-mono ml-2 text-11 font-normal text-muted">Play 1 · Recommended</span></p><h3 class="type-name mb-2">The claims teams</h3><dl class="grid max-w-measure grid-cols-1 gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 wide:max-w-none wide:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)]"><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Who</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span class="font-semibold">The claims teams</span><span class="text-muted"> · 50 to 500 staff</span><span class="mt-0.5 block">Runs it: Claims team leader · Signs it off: Head of claims</span><span class="mt-0.5 block text-muted">A mid-sized firm with its own claims line.</span></dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Why now</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">The July guidance.</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Not the right call if</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Complaints keep falling.</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Why this first</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Every call checked.</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">The problem</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">claims-teams pain 1: handlers say the complaints backlog grew after the storms<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://source-1.example/page" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">source-1.example</a> · 14 Jul 2026</span></span></div></dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Example firms</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">claims-teams firm 1</dd></div><div class="contents"><dt class="type-small font-semibold">Suits</dt><dd class="type-small min-w-0 max-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Email</dd></div></dl></section><section data-testid="confirm-card" class="border-t border-line pt-3"><h3 class="type-label mb-1.5">What Confirm does</h3><p data-testid="confirm-starts-with" class="type-small mb-1.5"><span class="font-semibold">Confirm starts with</span> The claims teams</p><ul class="grid max-w-measure gap-1"><li class="type-small">Starts with this play and the kind of buyer it aims at.</li><li class="type-small">Buys no emails and sends nothing. You review everyone first.</li></ul><p class="type-small mt-1.5 max-w-measure text-muted"><span class="font-semibold">Lawful basis you confirm:</span> <span data-testid="confirm-lawful">Legitimate interest: B2B offer, opt out in every email</span></p></section></div></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-research" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Research</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpanel" data-testid="rail-panel-brief" class="max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--relay-header-h,0px)-72px)] overflow-y-auto p-card"><div data-testid="brief-bare"><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Channel</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">UK telephony resellers and 3CX partners who sell and support phone systems for small and mid-sized businesses and could resell call analytics to them</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Kinds of organisation</dt><dd class="type-small">telephony reseller, 3CX partner</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">15 people over 4 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email, LinkedIn</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-3"><a data-testid="edit-brief" class="inline-flex min-h-6 items-center rounded-pill text-13 font-semibold text-action focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2" href="/campaigns/camp-partial/edit">Edit brief</a></div></div></div></aside></div></div>"`;

exports[`Campaigns in dark > renders live-researching 1`] = `"<div><div data-testid="campaign-header" class="-mx-6 mb-grid border-b border-line bg-panel px-6 pb-3 pt-1 wide:sticky wide:top-0 wide:z-10"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-1.5"><h1 class="type-display">Practice owners at independent vets in</h1></header><ol aria-label="Where this campaign is" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Brief</li><li data-testid="state-step" aria-current="step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-action text-on-action">Researching</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Plan ready</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Finding people</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Drafting</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Running</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Done</li></ol></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div data-testid="stage-summary" class="min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p data-testid="stage-line" class="type-body-large text-ink">Reading the market</p><p data-testid="stage-activity" class="type-small mt-0.5 text-muted">Running</p></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-grid wide:grid-cols-campaign"><div class="grid min-w-0 content-start gap-grid"><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">Researching</h2><p data-testid="researching-note" class="type-body">Reading around the brief now. Usually 20 to 45 minutes.</p><p class="type-label mb-1.5 mt-3">What Relay is producing</p><ul data-testid="researching-produces" class="grid gap-1"><li class="type-small text-muted">The market and why now</li><li class="type-small text-muted">The kinds of buyer, and who runs, champions and signs off</li><li class="type-small text-muted">Their pains, in their own words</li><li class="type-small text-muted">What to say, and what not to claim</li><li class="type-small text-muted">Example firms and how to find more</li><li class="type-small text-muted">Ranked campaign plays to choose from</li></ul></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpanel" data-testid="rail-panel-brief" class="max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--relay-header-h,0px)-72px)] overflow-y-auto p-card"><div data-testid="brief-bare"><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Direct</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">Practice owners at independent vets in Orkney</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">10 people over 3 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl></div></div></aside></div></div>"`;

exports[`Campaigns in dark > renders live-stopped 1`] = `
"<div><div data-testid="campaign-header" class="-mx-6 mb-grid border-b border-line bg-panel px-6 pb-3 pt-1 wide:sticky wide:top-0 wide:z-10"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-1.5"><h1 class="type-display">veterinary practices in Orkney</h1></header><ol aria-label="Where this campaign is" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Brief</li><li data-testid="state-step" aria-current="step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">Researching · stopped</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Plan ready</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Finding people</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Drafting</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Running</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Done</li></ol></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div data-testid="stage-summary" class="min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-grid wide:grid-cols-campaign"><div class="grid min-w-0 content-start gap-grid"><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card max-w-[760px]"><p class="type-small mb-3 rounded-input bg-warn-bg px-3 py-2.5 text-warn">Not enough evidence to write a plan. Nothing has been spent.</p><p data-testid="stop-reason" class="type-body mb-4">Orkney contains two veterinary organisations, not ten. Orkney.com's own guidance says "Orkney has two veterinary practices"; the Scottish Government's HIVSS list shows the same two; directories' "four practices" figure counts Northvet's three premises separately. The floor is three kinds of buyer with two seed firms each inside the scope — six distinct firms. Two exist, and a firm may be one seed only.

Size compounds it. Northvet, the larger, publishes 8 reception/administration staff out of ~32 employees; Flett &amp; Carmichael is single-site and publishes no staff count. The product is built for 5–250 contact-centre seats and the knowledge set excludes sub-5-seat operations outright, so at best one of the two clears the floor, and only just, against a £1,280 setup fee plus a £640 configuration review.

The sector is not wrong — the CMA's 23 September 2026 Orders deadline is a real GB-wide clock on veterinary client communication. The geography is smaller than the smallest viable campaign.</p><div class="grid gap-grid wide:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="type-label mb-1.5">What it did find</h3><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">The product knowledge set names sub-five-seat operations as an explicit exclusion from the ideal customer profile, on the grounds that per-seat price against the one-off setup fee is not commercially viable for either side.<span class="type-small block text-muted">No source. Relay inferred this from Knowledge article 'icp', section 'Not our ICP (explicit exclusions)', read this run.</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">The product is built for operations running between 5 and 250 contact-centre seats.<span class="type-small block text-muted">No source. Relay inferred this from Knowledge articles 'overview' and 'icp', read this run.</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Orkney has two veterinary practices, both offering an out-of-hours emergency service: Flett &amp; Carmichael and Northvet.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.orkney.com/news/dog-friendly-orkney" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">orkney.com</a></span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-warn-bg text-warn">a guess</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Commercial veterinary directories list four veterinary premises in Orkney: Northvet's Junction Road (Kirkwall), Lammaquoy (Harray) and North End Road (Stromness) sites, plus Flett &amp; Carmichael at Hatston Veterinary Centre Ltd, Kirkwall.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://vetpricecomparisonsite.co.uk/vets-in/kirkwall" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">vetpricecomparisonsite.co.uk</a> +2 · 30 Aug 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Northvet Veterinary Group's own business listing states it has 7 veterinary surgeons, 3 veterinary nurses, an animal nursing assistant, a practice manager and 8 reception/administration staff, across three branch surgeries covering all of Orkney including the outer isles.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.orkney.com/listings/northvet-veterinary-group" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">orkney.com</a></span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">moderate</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Flett &amp; Carmichael Veterinary Surgeons operates from a single Kirkwall address at Garrison Road, Hatston Industrial Estate, KW15 1GN, open Monday to Friday 8.45am–6pm and Saturday 9am–12 noon, with a 24-hour emergency service, covering small animal, farm and equine work.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.flettandcarmichael.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">flettandcarmichael.co.uk</a> +1</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">The Scottish Government's Highlands and Islands Veterinary Services Scheme list of participating island practices shows three Orkney entries — Northvet Veterinary Group at Lamaquoy, Harray; Flett and Carmichael Veterinary Surgeons at Garrison Road, Hatston Industrial Estate, Kirkwall; and Northvet Veterinary Group at 33 Junction Road, Kirkwall.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.gov.scot/publications/highlands-and-islands-veterinary-services-scheme-participating-island-practices" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">gov.scot</a> · 31 Jul 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">moderate</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">The CMA concluded its market investigation into veterinary services for household pets with a final decision report published 24 March 2026; the next stage gives the CMA six months to put legally binding Orders on businesses in place and to accept undertakings from the RCVS, so these will be in place by 23 September 2026.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/news/cma-concludes-market-investigation-with-major-reforms-to-veterinary-sector" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">gov.uk</a> +1 · 24 Mar 2026</span></span></div><div data-testid="pack-item" class="flex break-inside-avoid items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5"><span data-testid="confidence" class="type-mono inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-ground text-muted">weak</span><span class="type-small min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">There are around 1,500 businesses based in Orkney, with more than 90% employing fewer than 10 people.<span class="type-small block text-muted"><a href="https://www.orkney.com/life/live/start-a-business" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2">orkney.com</a></span></span></div></div><fieldset class="min-w-0"><legend class="type-label mb-1.5">What would help</legend><ul class="grid gap-chips"><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the region · option 1</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Keep veterinary practices, drop Orkney, and run the brief across Great Britain. The CMA's 23 September 2026 Orders on client communication apply to every GB veterinary business, and the corporate veterinary groups run central client-contact teams at the seat sizes the product is built for.</span><span data-testid="widen-becomes" class="type-small mt-1 block">Where becomes United Kingdom</span></li><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the region · option 2</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Keep Orkney and add the rest of the Scottish islands and Highlands. The Scottish Government's HIVSS list names practices in Shetland, Lewis and Harris, Uist, Skye, Islay, Mull and Tiree alongside the Orkney two — same 24/7 island obligation, same scheme, same CMA deadline, roughly ten organisations instead of two.</span><span data-testid="widen-becomes" class="type-small mt-1 block">Where becomes United Kingdom, Orkney, Shetland, Western Isles, Highland, Argyll and Bute</span></li><li data-testid="widening" class="py-1.5"><span data-testid="widen-heading" class="type-small block font-semibold">Widen the kind of organisation</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Stay in Orkney and drop the veterinary-only filter. Orkney has around 1,500 businesses and a council employing over a thousand people; the question becomes which Orkney employers run a multi-seat phone desk with recorded calls, rather than which vets do. Expect a short list either way.</span><span data-testid="widen-becomes" class="type-small mt-1 block">Kinds of organisation limit removed</span></li></ul><p data-testid="widen-note" class="type-small mt-2 text-muted">Choose one, and Relay looks again</p></fieldset></div></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpanel" data-testid="rail-panel-brief" class="max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--relay-header-h,0px)-72px)] overflow-y-auto p-card"><div data-testid="brief-bare"><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Direct</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">veterinary practices in Orkney</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom, Orkney (also Orkney Islands, Kirkwall, Stromness)</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Kinds of organisation</dt><dd class="type-small">veterinary practice</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">10 people over 3 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-3"><a data-testid="edit-brief" class="inline-flex min-h-6 items-center rounded-pill text-13 font-semibold text-action focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2" href="/campaigns/camp-stopped/edit">Edit brief</a></div></div></div></aside></div></div>"
`;

exports[`Campaigns in dark > renders page-plan-ready as signed 1`] = `"<div><div data-testid="campaign-header" class="-mx-6 mb-grid border-b border-line bg-panel px-6 pb-3 pt-1 wide:sticky wide:top-0 wide:z-10"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-1.5"><h1 class="type-display">Managed print partners, Midlands</h1></header><ol aria-label="Where this campaign is" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Brief</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Researching</li><li data-testid="state-step" aria-current="step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 bg-action text-on-action">Plan ready</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Finding people</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Drafting</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Running</li><li data-testid="state-step" class="type-mono rounded-pill px-2 py-0.5 text-11 text-muted">Done</li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill border-control px-4 py-2 text-13 font-semibold focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 transition-opacity duration-micro ease-standard hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 disabled:opacity-50 border-transparent bg-action text-on-action">Confirm plan</button></div></div><div class="mt-2"></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-grid wide:grid-cols-campaign"><div class="grid min-w-0 content-start gap-grid"><section class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel p-card shadow-card"><h2 class="type-label mb-2.5">The plan, and the research behind it</h2><div class="grid gap-chips wide:grid-cols-2"><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Who we found</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">The people who feel it are claims operations leads with twenty to sixty handlers and no way to see a week's calls at once.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 2 groups · 16 sources</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">The hook</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Your complaints are up and the calls behind them are unread. Read all of them instead of one in fifty.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 1 reason it is now</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Their pain, in their words</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Claims teams in mid-sized UK insurers are reading every call by hand and finding the same three problems too late.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 7 shown</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Seed firms and who to target</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Northgate Claims Services, Westbury Mutual, Calder Insurance Group, Penrith Underwriting</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 4 firms</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] border-dashed"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">What Relay could not find</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Nothing found on what these teams currently spend on quality checking.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 1 unknown · nothing is guessed here</span></button></div></div></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpanel" data-testid="rail-panel-brief" class="max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--relay-header-h,0px)-72px)] overflow-y-auto p-card"><div data-testid="brief-bare"><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Motion</dt><dd class="type-small">Channel</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Who</dt><dd class="type-small">Managed print dealers in the Midlands who resell service contracts. MD or Sales Director.</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Where</dt><dd class="type-small">United Kingdom</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">How many</dt><dd class="type-small">15 people over 4 weeks</dd></div><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Channels</dt><dd class="type-small">Email</dd></div></dl></div></div></aside></div></div>"`;

