x-w-measure [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Email</dd></div></dl></section><section data-testid="confirm-card" class="border-t border-line pt-3"><h3 class="type-label mb-1.5">What Confirm does</h3><p data-testid="confirm-starts-with" class="type-small mb-1.5"><span class="font-semibold">Confirm starts with</span> The claims teams</p><ul class="grid max-w-measure gap-1"><li class="type-small">Starts with this play and the kind of buyer it aims at.</li><li class="type-small">Buys no emails and sends nothing. You review everyone first.</li></ul><p class="type-small mt-1.5 max-w-measure text-muted"><span class="font-semibold">Lawful basis you confirm:</span> <span data-testid="confirm-lawful">Legitimate interest: B2B offer, opt out in every email</span></p></section></div></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-research" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Research</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpane