nd it</h2><div class="grid gap-chips wide:grid-cols-2"><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Who we found</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">The people who feel it are claims operations leads with twenty to sixty handlers and no way to see a week's calls at once.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 2 groups · 16 sources</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">The hook</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Your complaints are up and the calls behind them are unread. Read all of them instead of one in fifty.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 1 reason it is now</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Their pain, in their words</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Claims teams in mid-sized UK insurers are reading every call by hand and finding the same three problems too late.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 7 shown</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">Seed firms and who to target</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Northgate Claims Services, Westbury Mutual, Calder Insurance Group, Penrith Underwriting</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 4 firms</span></button></div><div data-testid="plan-card" class="min-w-0 rounded-input border border-line bg-ground p-4 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] border-dashed"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="w-full text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2"><span class="type-name block">What Relay could not find</span><span class="type-small block text-muted">Nothing found on what these teams currently spend on quality checking.</span><span class="type-small mt-1.5 block text-muted">show · 1 unknown · nothing is guessed here</span></button></div></div></section></div><aside data-testid="support-rail" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-panel wide:sticky wide:top-[calc(var(--relay-header-h,0px)+16px)]"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Alongside this campaign" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 border-b border-line px-3 pt-2"><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-spend" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-transparent text-muted hover:text-ink">Spend</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-testid="rail-tab-brief" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="-mb-px border-b-2 px-2 pb-2 pt-1 text-13 font-semibold transition-colors duration-micro ease-standard focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 border-action text-ink">Brief</button></div><div role="tabpanel" data-testid="rail-panel-brief" class="max-h-[calc(100vh-var(--relay-header-h,0px)-72px)] overflow-y-auto p-card"><div data-testid="brief-bare"><dl class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5"><div data-testid="brief-field" class="contents"><dt class="type-small text-muted">Product</dt><dd class="type-small">Insights360</dd></div><div 